s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079200/extras/3cae68785cad469ae30b1d2238c713b4.poster.avif?t=1694516312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079200/extras/3cae68785cad469ae30b1d2238c713b4.webm?t=1694516312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079200/extras/3cae68785cad469ae30b1d2238c713b4.mp4?t=1694516312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Fast-paced action gameplay, shoot hearts from your hammer, pogo jump on enemies, dodge lasers!<br></li><li> Gorgeous Pixel Art Graphics<br></li><li> Retro-inspired Exploration with a diverse world to explore<br></li><li> Intense bosses with challenging patterns<br></li><li> Uncover Hidden Secrets!<br></li><li> Eccentric Hidden NPCs with new Quests<br></li><li> Upgradable Items, and Power Ups<br></li><li> Cute Girls With Hammers!</li></ul><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079200/extras/41a7aa4f483fd9e3cff0693a5fa7c74c.poster.avif?t=1694516312\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079200/extras/41a7aa4f483fd9e3cff0693a5fa7c74c.apng?t=1694516312\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
